: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 10pt;\">: 23. 2. 20. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 10pt;\">∼ </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 10pt;\">11. 15.  </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.6pt; font-size: 10pt;\">※ </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.6pt; font-size: 10pt;\">매월 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.6pt; font-size: 10pt;\">20</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.6pt; font-size: 10pt;\">일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.6pt; font-size: 10pt;\">~</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.6pt; font-size: 10pt;\">익월 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.6pt; font-size: 10pt;\">15</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.6pt; font-size: 10pt;\">일 월별 선착순 접수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.6pt; font-size: 10pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.6pt; font-size: 10pt;\">총 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.6pt; font-size: 10pt;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.6pt; font-size: 10pt;\">회 모집</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.6pt; font-size: 10pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height:170%;mso-pagination:n