pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.3pt; font-size: 10pt;\">근로</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.3pt; font-size: 10pt;\">), </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.3pt; font-size: 10pt;\">부채</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.3pt; font-size: 10pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.3pt; font-size: 10pt;\">금융</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.3pt; font-size: 10pt;\">), </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.3pt; font-size: 10pt;\">주거</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.3pt; font-size: 10pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.3pt; font-size: 10pt;\">과의존 중 택 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.3pt; font-size: 10pt;\">1   * </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.3pt; font-size: 10pt;\">프로그램</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.3pt; font-size: 10pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.3pt; font-size: 10pt;\">청년상담소</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.3pt; font-size: 10pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.3pt; font-size: 10pt;\">에 대한 자세한 내용은 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.3pt; font-size: 10pt;\">[</span><s